# Every stage directory is a Docker build context and every stage Dockerfile
# copies the whole of it into the image, so anything left lying about here gets
# baked in.  Nothing below is a file the stage needs: it is the debris that
# accumulates from running the suite locally, plus editor backups.  The same
# list ships in all three stage directories of this task -- a stage that
# excluded something the others kept would produce an image nobody could
# reproduce from the tree.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*~
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
# A local run of this suite installs a dependency closure and builds a bundle.
# Both land in the working directory the runner was invoked from, which is often
# this one, and neither is an input.
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*
